188
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:56,391
I don't know if they have any public comments to make.

189
00:19:56,411 --> 00:19:59,833
So I don't know if we should open it up to them to give them an opportunity.

190
00:20:00,233 --> 00:20:06,837
